  "title": "Consult: statutory construction on the never-transmitted bollo \u2014 cure, sanction regime, ravvedimento (DIG-623)",
  "description": "# Claude seat brief \u2014 statutory construction on the never-transmitted bollo (DIG-623)\n\n**This is a bounded consultant job, not general capacity. Keep it inside one 5-hour window.** If you cannot finish inside one, stop and report what you have plus what is left. Do not run across a window boundary.\n\n## Why you, and why not a free model\n\nThe Accountant (DIG-599) already did the retrieval: every primary text below was read and quoted in full at source. What is left is **statutory construction** \u2014 reconciling two sanction regimes that both appear to apply, and asking whether a cure mechanism can reach a document that already exists. Free models do not resolve that class of question reliably, and the Accountant explicitly declined to guess. That is exactly this seat's job.\n\n**Do not spend your window re-finding what the Accountant already quoted.** The retrieval routes, the working endpoints and the dead ends are all listed in the two source files below. Use them directly. Your budget goes on the reasoning, not on document hunting.\n\n## Facts already CONFIRMED \u2014 take as given, do not re-derive\n\n- `INV-2026-001`, a EUR 2,00 bollo item, was **never transmitted to SdI** (DIG-579, unaltered\n\n[truncated, 12085 characters total; open the issue for the full brief]",
